Local research package assembled from the supplied H-BSCM materials.
The published H-BSCM replication deposit by Xiaohua Ma is licensed under
CC BY 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).
Source: https://doi.org/10.17632/4vx9dcbpvm.1
Modifications include package interfaces, validation, summaries and examples.
Additional local scripts and empirical datasets retain their original
terms; no additional redistribution rights are asserted for those files.
pblasso is a separate dependency distributed by Pang, Liu and Xu in
https://doi.org/10.7910/DVN/B6SWA1.
